OL,3,GNEWSABridgewater Hall celebrates 30
OL,4,Ayears of live music
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Manchester's best-known cultural
OL,7,Fvenues, Bridgewater Hall, is marking
OL,8,Fits 30th anniversary with a season of
OL,9,Fspecial concerts.
OL,11,FThe first will take place later and aim
OL,12,Fto blend sounds from the city's rich
OL,13,Fand diverse musical history with
OL,14,Fperformances from Rowetta, Matt Wilde
OL,15,Fand the Greater Manchester Youth
OL,16,FOrchestra.
OL,18,FThe Halle Orchestra, based at
OL,19,FBridgewater Hall for its entire
OL,20,Fhistory, will pay homage to its 1996
OL,21,Fopening night concert with a
OL,22,Fcommemorative performance on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
