OL,3,GNEWSABridgewater Hall celebrates 30
OL,4,Ayears of live music
OL,5,
OL,6,FBridgewater Hall's CEO Andrew Bolt said
OL,7,Fthe concerts would reflect the
OL,8,F"evolving landscape" of Manchester's
OL,9,Fmusical history, tying together its
OL,10,Fclassical heritage with more
OL,11,Fcontemporary performances.
